mes ((-1,0)\\cup (0,1)) \\\\  & =((0,2)\\times (-1,0))\\cup ((0,2)\\times (0,1)).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A & ={∬}_{(0,2)\\times (-1,0)}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(0,2)\\times (0,1)}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{(0,2)\\times (-1,0)}(x+y)\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(0,2)\\times (0,1)}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186129872 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-5ba92148-b911-57fa-bcc8-d6592d9da4b9" :answer/id #uuid "5ba92148-b911-57fa-bcc8-d6592d9da4b9"] ["answer-5ba92148-b911-57fa-bcc8-d6592d9da4b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5ba92148-b911-57fa-bcc8-d6592d9da4b9" :answer/value "{∬}_{(-1,1)}(x+y)\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(0,2)}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)\\,\\text{d}A"] ["answer-48d84918-aaf4-5e48-802a-eb621ffae666" :answer/id #uuid "48d84918-aaf4-5e48-802a-eb621ffae666"] ["answer-48d84918-aaf4-5e48-802a-eb621ffae666" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-48d84918-aaf4-5e48-802a-eb621ffae666" :answer/value "{∬}_{(0,1)\\times (-1,1)}(x+y)\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(1,2)\\times (-1,1)}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)\\,\\text{d}A"] ["answer-c5b9d0b8-9a3f-5bdc-b4d0-bb4eb57acfcf" :answer/id #uuid "c5b9d0b8-9a3f-5bdc-b4d0-bb4eb57acfcf"] ["answer-c5b9d0b8-9a3f-5bdc-b4d0-bb4eb57acfcf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c5b9d0b8-9a3f-5bdc-b4d0-bb4eb57acfcf" :answer/value "{∬}_{(0,2)\\times (-1,0)}(x+y)\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(0,2)\\times (0,1)}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)\\,\\text{d}A"] ["answer-822a278f-47f8-5535-9796-535bd9d05cea" :answer/id #uuid "822a278f-47f8-5535-9796-535bd9d05cea"] ["answer-822a278f-47f8-5535-9796-535bd9d05cea" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-822a278f-47f8-5535-9796-535bd9d05cea" :answer/value "{∬}_{(0,2)\\times (-1,1)}(x+y)\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{(0,2)\\times (-1,1)}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y)\\,\\text{d}A"] ["answer-34b43744-10b8-5bdd-86b0-6a7b66637027" :answer/id #uuid "34b43744-10b8-5bdd-86b0-6a7b66637027"] ["answer-34b43744-10b8-5bdd-86b0-6a7b6663